scn 1
# AR-07 (PLAN 3.4): a blocking feature lands ON the shared goal cell at tick 300, with the group's field done and its slots claimed.
# 200 2x2 movers share one click, move (audit: registrations +1, groups +1, fields +2 -- one refresh of the old
# group and one bounded field for the ONE re-registered member, because claimSlot re-points every goal to its
# own slot cell so only the member whose slot IS the blocked cell fails legal(goal)). PLAN: AR-07 `reseat()`
# re-seeds in place -- the work.registrations / fields_built / field_work totals after tick 300 fall.
name goalblock-200
ticks 3000
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
wanderers off
map flat 300 120
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 200 rect 20 40 80 70 pitch=3
probe claims
region goal 180 40 215 80
churn 199 59 2 2 every=1 from=300 until=301
at 1 move A 200 60
